<title>INDIA: India Apr 96-Feb 97 steel output 20.37 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India Apr 96-Feb 97 steel output 20.37 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 20.37 million tonnes of steel between April 1996 and February 1997 compared with 19.06 million tonnes in the same period a year earlier, the Steel Ministry said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>India exported one million tonnes of steel between April 1996 and February 1997 against 731,000 tonnes in the same period a year earlier, the statement said.</p>
<p>Domestic consumption of steel between April 1996 and February 1997 was 19.95 million tonnes, an increase of four percent over the same period a year earlier, it said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
